            "title": "Components",
            "text": "Components\n\nList each component you use, with a link to its design and its code, and who looks after it.\n\n- Button: primary, quiet, outline, danger.\n- Field: label above, hint below, error in place.\n- Dialog: one question, two answers.\n",
